WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.177
Here is a simple Spark notebook workflow A file is
read into a DataFrame

00:00:07.101 --> 00:00:12.627
The DataFrame is registered as a temporary view Then
Spark SQL queries that

00:00:12.641 --> 00:00:18.532
view This code is not meant for the browser practice
engine because it requires

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:24.167
a real Spark session The important idea is the
connection between files

00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:26.996
DataFrames temporary views and SQL
